# clog orchestrator version — the single source of truth for which clog binary
# both developers and CI install. Consumed by:
#   - the dev install:  CLOG_VERSION_FILE=.clog-version  get-clog.sh
#   - the CI bootstrap: .github/actions/setup-clog (reads this file)
# Pinning here — not a floating tag or a secret — is what keeps dev and CI on
# byte-identical clog. Bump deliberately.
#
# This repo does not read it: its own workflows set self-build: true and compile
# clog from the checkout, which is what lets it go green before it has ever
# published a release.
v1.0.0
